  "In a merge replay of 747 unique co-active PR pairs (one per repository) from AI agent PRs on GitHub, the textual conflict rate was 41.7% for cross-agent pairs versus 19.8% for intra-agent pairs, with non-overlapping 95% confidence intervals.": 1,
  "Intra-agent pairs make up 99.5% of all co-activity among agent PRs, so the overall textual conflict rate is dominated by the nearly 20% rate for same-agent pairs.": 1,
  "With a same-day window (k=0) the study found 580,913 co-active PR pairs across 1,129 repositories, and 79.4% of agent PRs were co-active with another PR; with a 7-day window 95.0% of PRs were co-active and 53.4% of repositories had co-activity.": 1
 }
